{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00457","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青阳告谢，朱明戒序。\n延长是祈，敬陈椒醑。\n博硕斯荐，笙镛备举。\n庶尽肃恭，非馨稷黍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}